From: iHaiDeeZ <ihaideezi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:46:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 32/38] PS4: wineserver parks idle files for the app's budget
 of open files (about 250 for all its processes): closed, opened again by name
 at the same file pointer when next used; files lent to programs are not kept
 in their fd cache

---
 server/fd.c      | 283 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 server/mapping.c |  12 ++
 server/request.c |   8 ++
 server/thread.h  |   3 +
 4 files changed, 304 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/server/fd.c b/server/fd.c
index f70bec3..2b7fb5c 100644
--- a/server/fd.c
+++ b/server/fd.c
@@ -162,11 +162,27 @@ struct fd
     struct completion   *completion;  /* completion object attached to this fd */
     apc_param_t          comp_key;    /* completion key to set in completion events */
