From aa7b20b57a6d6b0a7fec11d53688eb88d58e9c46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iHaiDeeZ <ihaideezi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:24:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 34/38] PS4: nsiproxy's interfaces from the PS4's kernel: the
 hardware address from SIOCGIFCONF's link level entries, FreeBSD's ioctl
